                │ User Input  │
                └──────┬──────┘
                       │
                TRUST BOUNDARY
                       │
                       ▼
                ┌─────────────┐
                │ API Gateway │
                └──────┬──────┘
                       │
                       ▼
                ┌─────────────┐
                │ AI Service  │
                └──────┬──────┘
                       │
                TRUST BOUNDARY
                       │
                       ▼
                ┌─────────────┐
                │ Tools/Data  │
                └─────────────┘
```

Students should ask:

> What assumptions are being made at each boundary?

